      "title": "What Simon\u2019s Request Clarifies",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block_3",
          "text": "This passage resists treating spiritual gifts, authority, or visible signs as commodities, credentials, or marks of spiritual rank. Across Acts, the narrated order and presence of faith, baptism, prayer, laying on of hands, and Spirit reception vary; absence of one element should not automatically be treated as exclusion.",
